    "summary": "During your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), the bearer's unit can regain **destroyed** models:\n\n- up to D3 models\n- up to 3 models instead, if you control an [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/level-of-control) that unit is in range of\n\nDestroyed **CHARACTER** models in an **Attached unit** can't come back this way. A returned model's **[[ONE SHOT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/one-shot)** weapons fired before it was destroyed still count as fired.",
